Ampere front end synced from seedds/nxnative main (MIT) 339d9f23: the instruction forms it has since gained (TEX with a
handle in a register, 0xf60 family; F2IP, F2I / I2F 64; UP2UR, BMSK, ATOMS.CAS, SURED), comparisons honouring .FTZ, a
dead-code pass that keeps a coordinate of a multi-output read, bindless reads through table handles, LDC .IS.
Kept from this tree: TensorPass and its emitters (Hmma.cs rewrites them), GlobalToStorage (its newer pool table needs
host changes), AstOptimizer, Translator. Tensor LDSM passes stride: false: its mode bits share the field.

